# Case Study

## Project Title

**Student Performance Prediction using Machine Learning**

---

## Problem

Educational institutions often struggle to identify students who may need academic support before their performance declines. Manual analysis of student records is time-consuming and can miss important patterns hidden in the data.

---

## What I Did

I built an end-to-end machine learning solution using **Python, Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn, and Matplotlib**.

The project involved:

- Collecting and understanding the dataset
- Cleaning and preprocessing data
- Handling missing values
- Selecting important features
- Splitting the dataset into training and testing sets
- Training multiple machine learning models
- Comparing model performance
- Evaluating results using accuracy and other performance metrics
- Documenting the complete workflow on GitHub

---

## What Came of It

This project demonstrates my ability to develop a complete machine learning workflow, from data preparation to model evaluation. It improved my practical understanding of supervised learning, feature engineering, model comparison, and evaluation. The project also strengthened my experience with GitHub documentation and writing maintainable code.

