Student performance data contains patterns that are difficult to identify through manual analysis. To address this, I developed a complete machine learning pipeline using Python and Scikit-learn. I cleaned and prepared the dataset, engineered relevant features, trained multiple machine learning models, compared their performance, and evaluated the results using appropriate metrics. The complete workflow was documented in GitHub, demonstrating my ability to build practical, end-to-end machine learning solutions rather than simply training a model.

